Oratcl for Windows

This directory contains a prebuilt version of Oratcl for the windows
operating system.  It was compiled with stubs enabled, with Microsoft
visual studion 6.0, and with Tcl 8.3.2.

There are 4 files necessary for oratcl to operate on windows.

they are : oratcl32.dll oralob.tcl oralong.tcl pkgIndex.tcl

oratcl32.dll needs to be in your tcl\lib

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl32.dll

the 3 tcl files need to be in tcl\lib\oratcl3.2

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl3.2\pkgIndex.tcl
	     c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl3.2\oralob.tcl
	     c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl3.2\oralong.tcl
